[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3401823124","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111602#issuecomment-3401823124","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111602","id":3401823124,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Kw7OU","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-14T13:23:26Z","updated_at":"2025-10-14T13:23:26Z","body":"I think you forgot one interesting use-case for header definitions: It allows compilers (without LTO, which is quite a few configurations for us) to inline functions. If the function is simple enough that we think the code could substantially benefit from being inlined, we want it to be in the header. \r\n\r\nHowever, it looks like most of these functions are long enough not to qualify.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3401823124/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3401841974","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111602#issuecomment-3401841974","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111602","id":3401841974,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Kw_02","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-14T13:25:33Z","updated_at":"2025-10-14T13:25:33Z","body":"It's also relevant to consider other aspects of inlining where some performance gains can be had even with larger methods, but this probably doesn't matter for most of these methods, a few of them might be good to have be inlineable though","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3401841974/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3401932221","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111602#issuecomment-3401932221","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111602","id":3401932221,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7KxV29","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-14T13:37:31Z","updated_at":"2025-10-14T13:42:25Z","body":"I think we can merge this and if we find issues with performance we can move methods back to header scope, it shouldn't matter for the vast majority of them (`vec2_cross` might actually be worth keeping in the header as it's trivial, and `is_point_in_circle`, but they require includes to be kept in the header so I'd suggest moving them and checking in the future what impact it might have)\r\n\r\nActually I'd suggest moving `vec2_cross` to `vector_2.h` and deprecating the case in `Geometry3D`, have the `vec2_cross` as a globally accessible method on `Vector2` like `vec3_cross` in `vector_3.h`","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3401932221/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3402463163","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111602#issuecomment-3402463163","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111602","id":3402463163,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7KzXe7","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-14T15:37:18Z","updated_at":"2025-10-14T15:51:24Z","body":"> Since this has a run-time performance impact, it needs to be tested to ensure that there isn't a performance regression.\r\n\r\nMoving functions from headers to cpp files is very unlikely to have a performance impact, unless the function was previously inlined from performance sensitive code. The functions in the PR don't look like they fit this description. I don't think merging this is risky.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3402463163/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4771795187","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111602#issuecomment-4771795187","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111602","id":4771795187,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHGvQ8w","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-22T18:50:56Z","updated_at":"2026-06-22T18:50:56Z","body":"Sufficiently superseded by #115452. If revisited, it'd be alongside performance metrics","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4771795187/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]